Plot:
During a round in which Sir Battlescarred saved: Spot from a snowball, Jewel from falling jewels, and Pix E. from going down some stairs. He receives compliments in return, but he left Pix E. early due to his secret fear of fireflies. The latter, however, feels that she did not manage to thank him completely and goes to visit him at her castle. When Pix E. brought her pet firefly to the location, Sir freaks out and fakes a girlish voice to say that she wasn't home.
After being discovered, Sir confesses to Pix E. that he is afraid of insects and the dark, for which she agrees to help him with magic powders that do not end up working and later, with the help of his magic book, he learns of the existence of a amulet that removes fears located in the " Cave of Impenetrable Darkness ". He therefore goes with Dot to help her look for an arrow-shaped constellation, which always points to the cave. On the way to the place, the lalas meet Jewel and Battlescarred wishes her that "her path is surrounded by flowers". Sir Battlescarred is sad because he doesn't how to be brave like a knight. They suggest being brave himself. The Schwartzman Quartet enter, singing "Anyone Can Be Brave." Once The Schwartzman Quartet leave, Brody, Pix E., Peanut, Spot, and Jewel say that they can help Sir Battlescarred be brave like a real knight.
As the legend says that the knight must take the amulet by himself, Battlescarred does it accompanied by his pet. Later, the group hears two consecutive screams from Battlescarred and the girls go inside to make sure he's okay. However they slipped into a well while Battlescarred finds himself with the amulet pressing a fake brick that gave him access to it. Sir with the highest confidence caused by the placebo effect of the amulet, he is not afraid of the dark and the Firefly who went with him to ask him for help on the group.
Sir goes to the place escorted by the firefly and with the help of his shield, goes up to the lalas with a system of pulleys. After rescuing them, Sir realizes that he had lost his amulet during the rescue and Dot tells him that she didn't need it after all he had done. Sir, however, turns to look for it and ends up giving it to Jewel, who receives it very gladly. Later after seeing fruit with purple dots, Sir flees to the horizon.
ewel has a tradition of taking an annual portrait with a new diamond necklace each year, however she doesn't have any jewelry for tomorrow's portrait with Spot. After being saved by Battlescarred and meeting him a second time. Jewel makes herself a flower necklace and a necklace based on ice stalagtites at the Mittens house , however neither works for her. Or that was until Battlescarred gave him the amulet at the end of the episode. Brody hears his mom calling him. It is louder than usual because they're by the cave. Brody, Jewel, Spot, Peanut, and Pix E. leave as Sir Battlescarred does a knightly pose. In the clubhouse, they came back from the magic door that they used to be brought to the cave. In the final scene, Brody and Jewel sing the goodbye song, then they leave the clubhouse.
